					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "FROM POLAR\n\nThe From Polar node takes a polar coordinate and translates it to a cartesian coordinate.\nSince Wire is cartesian based, this node can be used as a conversion step.\n\nDue to the unique properties of the polar system, this node can also be used to create spiral patterns or place objects within a circle."
					}
				},
